ing system provide uninterrupted performance and long battery life.</p><p><br></p><p>Built for Bangladesh’s load-shedding conditions, the MR-UT2000 offers high efficiency (up to 95% in line mode), strong surge capacity, and advanced protection features—making it an ideal choice for continuous and dependable power backup.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>2000VA / 2000W high-capacity inverter</li><li>Pure sine wave output for sensitive devices</li><li>Fast transfer time ≤10ms</li><li>High efficiency (&gt;95% line mode)</li><li>Intelligent microprocessor control system</li><li>Advanced 3-stage battery charging (Boost CC → CV → Float)</li><li>Strong surge capacity up to 9000VA</li><li>Supports up to 2HP motor load</li><li>Power saver mode for low load devices</li><li>Full protection: overload, short circuit, overcharge, voltage control</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Must PV18-3024 ECO 3000VA Pure Sine Wave Solar Inverter","href":"/must-pv18-3024-eco-3000va-pure-sine-wave-solar-inverter","now":"32,500৳","old":"35,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Marsriva MR-SPF3.6K-LP1-TL20E Solar Inverter","href":"/marsriva-mr-spf36k-lp1-tl20e-solar-inverter","now":"","old":"","single":"34,000৳"},{"name":"MR-SPF6.5K-LP1-TL20E – 6.5kW Hybrid Solar Inverter","href":"/mr-spf65k-lp1-tl20e%E2%80%9365kw-hybrid-solar-inverter","now":"","old":"","single":"56,000৳"},{"name":"Marsriva MR-SPF2K-LP1-TL20E Solar Inverter","href":"/marsriva-mr-spf2k-lp1-tl20e-solar-inverter","now":"","old":"","single":"28,000৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/marsiva-mr-uf1200-1200va-smart-line-interactive-ups","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Marsiva/MR-UF1200/MR-UF1200-500